{"id": 57, "ts": 1780413664.7156618, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 4, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I\u2019ve reconsidered my earlier inclination toward Candidate\u202fD after weighing the full set of evidence. While D shows strong problem\u2011solving and responsibility, the concerns about being moody and a loner raise serious doubts about crew cooperation and professional communication\u2014both critical for long\u2011haul flights. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB combines high reliability (very conscientious), proven stress resilience (handles stress very well), and solid technical judgment (good at assessing weather conditions and excellent computer skills). The only drawback is occasional tone issues, but that is a more manageable communication flaw than the deeper cooperation concerns we see with D. Therefore, I now recommend Candidate\u202fB as the best overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
